{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れさまぁや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のコメント"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近コメント数が100行くのを楽しみにしながら、毎日何回もコメントをみたり！\n沢山読み返してる日々です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※すみません！華麗にスルーしてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずんだもちを食べるまあや！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして、期末テストももうすぐ終わります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うひゃぁぁぁ！        疲れました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと少し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばろってぃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！もうすぐ夏休みだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やったー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつライブがあっても対応出来るように、レッスンとか頑張んなきゃっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の実力じゃぁきっといたいめにあう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やりたい！って思う気持ちだけじゃぁ無理だと思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブだと何曲も歌うはずだから！\n体力もつけて、歌も上手にならなきゃっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のうちから努力の種まきしとかなきゃっ！\nチャンスがきたら、綺麗に咲かなきゃいけないからねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うしゃーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁやのことみててねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばろってぃー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏っぽく早くもサングラスのまあや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！そうそう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"駅にね、誰でもかいていい、七夕のお願いを書く紙があって、ろってぃちゃんと一緒にお願い事を書いてきたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イェイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはなんかお願い事したかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね！\n質問返しもそろそしなきゃいけないんだけど.........テスト期間中だからまた今度でいいかなぁ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も一日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆がスマイルでありますように！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/3861295/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}